{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["香柏树的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["第十一年三月一日，耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“人子啊，你要对埃及王法老和他的百姓说，",{"text":"“‘谁能比你强大呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，亚述曾是黎巴嫩的一棵香柏树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"枝繁叶茂，遮天蔽日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高耸入云。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水源滋润它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深泉使它茁壮成长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"溪流四围环绕它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"浇灌着林间的树木。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"丰沛的水源使它高过田间所有的树木，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"枝子长得又粗又长。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"空中的飞鸟都在它的枝头上搭窝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田间的野兽都在它的枝条下生产，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有的大国都住在它的荫下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它高大美丽，枝干修长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为树根深入丰沛的水源，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"连上帝园中的香柏树也不能与它相比。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松树不能与它的枝干相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"枫树不能与它的枝条相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝园中的树木没有一棵能与它媲美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使它枝繁叶茂，美丽无比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致上帝伊甸园里的树木都羡慕它。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["“因此，主耶和华说，‘因为它树干高大，树梢高耸入云，心高气傲，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我要把它交在列国的首领手里，他必按照它的邪恶惩治它。我丢弃了它。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["列邦中最残暴的人要把它砍倒，丢弃在那里，它折断的枝干散落在山间和河谷中。世上各族都离开它的荫下，弃他而去，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["天上的飞禽要栖身在那折断的树干上，地上的走兽要躺卧在它的枝条中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["故此，水边的树木都不再傲然矗立，高耸入云，水源充足的大树也不再如此高大，因为它们都注定要与下坟墓的人一同死亡，落到阴间的深处。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["“主耶和华说，‘它下到阴间的那天，我要使哀声响起，使深渊闭塞，江河止息，洪水停滞。我要使黎巴嫩为它哀哭，田野的树木都因它而枯萎。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我将它与下坟墓的人一同抛到阴间时，列国听见它坠落的响声，都恐惧颤抖。伊甸园中的树木和黎巴嫩水源充足的上好树木都在阴间得到安慰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["列国中活在它荫庇下的爪牙都与它一同坠入阴间，到丧身刀下的人那里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["“‘伊甸园的树木中，谁能与你的威荣相比呢？然而你必与伊甸园的树木一同下到阴间，躺卧在未受割礼的人当中，与丧身刀下的人在一起。 “‘这就是法老和他百姓的结局。这是主耶和华说的。’”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}